  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 00c68ee4d7dceb346ba4f60d3f40e2cd, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  npcID: Daisy_1
  npcName: Daisy
  dialogueLines:
  - "I missed you, Daisy. Moving here has been a hassle, especially since I couldn't
    talk to you!\r"
  - "Oh dear me, it's not your fault. In fact, I should apologize for not contacting
    you. You see, I was kinda stuck. Some might even say\u2026 \u201CPlanted\u201D
    in place! \r"
  - "Heh\u2026\u2026\u2026\r\r"
  - Well, now that we're reunited, HOW ABOUT YOU SHOW ME AROUND YOUR NEW PLACE?
  - CLICK ON THE ARROW AT THE BOTTOM OF THE SCREEN MOVE TO ANOTHER ROOM!
  - "GOOD JOB! NOW IF YOU WANT TO ADD SOMETHING TO YOUR INVENTORY, PRESS ON IT OR
    COMPLETE A PUZZLE. \r\n"
  - YOU MAY NOW ADD ME TO YOUR INVENTORY BY PRESSING ON ME <3
  speakerNames:
  - Player
  - Daisy
  - Player
  - Daisy
