  npcID: Gurt_Kitchen_2
  npcName: Gurt
  dialogueLines:
  - "Gurble gurt, I've come with some terrible news\u2026\u2026 :( "
  - 'Huh? What is it? '
  - "There's\u2026 There's\u2026. NO MORE GURTZLE!"
  - '(Oh shoot, I ran out of it already?!?!?) Alright, Gurt. I will go out and get
    some. '
  - Ok.... gurt. *sob*
